# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What the tools read and write stays out: game files, exported courses and
# levels, recordings, captures and screenshots belong to whoever owns the game
# or the data, not to this repository. Kept out by folder AND by file type, so
# a file dropped somewhere new is still left out. To version a file of one of
# these types on purpose (a documentation image, say), add it with `git add -f`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Working directories: exports, probe dumps, inputs and recordings.
*/.out/
*/.probe/
*/example/
*/examples/
*/captures/
*/recordings/
*/scans/
laps/
races/
courses/

# Unreal plugin build output.
unreal/**/Binaries/
unreal/**/Intermediate/

# Converted model weights, generated by gamecapture/tools/export_onnx.py.
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors

# Data, by type: telemetry, tables, lap recordings.
*.parquet
*.csv
*.tsv
*.npz
*.npy
*.ibt
*.lap.json
*.match.json
*.tele.gz
*.dem
*.dem.zst
*.dem.bz2
*.rar
*.bz2
*.zst

# Maps, levels, models and game archives, by type.
*.glb
*.gltf
*.obj
*.stl
*.ply
*.fbx
*.kn5
*.pak
*.utoc
*.ucas
*.uasset
*.umap
*.minizip
*.modelbin
*.swatchbin
*.cdae
*.dae
*.ter
*.zip
*.7z

# Media, by type: gameplay video, screenshots, map images.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.avi
*.webm
*.avif
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.bmp
